OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of shopping precinct
OL,4,Aundecided, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of a Doncaster shopping
OL,7,Fprecinct appears uncertain, as part of
OL,8,Fit does not appear in new images of a
OL,9,Fcity centre masterplan.
OL,11,FCity of Doncaster Council has launched
OL,12,Fits vision for the city centre up to
OL,13,F2050, including changes in the Civic
OL,14,FQuarter and Market, and continued
OL,15,Fdevelopment of the Waterfront.
OL,17,FThere has been speculation over the
OL,18,Ffuture of Waterdale as the council
OL,19,Fcontinues to work towards a deal to
OL,20,Ftake ownership of the site south of
OL,21,FKingsgate.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
