OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of shopping precinct
OL,4,Aundecided, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are indications from the
OL,7,Fauthority's chosen developer Capital &
OL,8,FCentric that the site will be knocked
OL,9,Fdown, but the council says it is
OL,10,Flooking at options and has not made a
OL,11,Ffinal decision.
